**Hook input parsing:**

**Location:** `/Users/matthiaswenz/Development/entire/worktrees/cli-claude-statusline/cmd/entire/cli/agent/claudecode/types.go` (lines 32-65)

The sessionInfoRaw struct shows the JSON structure from hooks:

